   "text": "A user can adjust the stiffness and strength selection within the design space in the Performance Estimation Tool (PET) using sliders located along the bottom and right side of the design space or by selecting values from dropdown menus associated with buttons for multiple of minimum base shear and design story drift [fema-p-58-6:p79:c0]. The red dot on the design space graphic represents the current selection, which can be moved to adjust stiffness and strength [fema-p-58-6:p79:c0].",
